{"EmbeddableHost's before_validation calls sub! on self.host without guarding for nil, causing 500 errors instead of 422 validation failures when host param is missing": 0.9524093270301819, "Admin::EmbeddableHostsController#update and #destroy fetch records with where(...).first and call methods without handling not-found, causing 500s for invalid IDs instead of 404s": 0.9515821933746338, "Migration copies raw host strings from embeddable_hosts site setting without normalization, so entries containing schemes/paths will not match EmbeddableHost.record_for_host which compares against URI(host).host": 0.9709351658821106, "Migration interpolates host value directly into SQL without quoting, so values containing quotes can break the migration": 0.9577590227127075, "Migration indexes into SQL results with [0] for embed_category and uncategorized_category_id without checking for empty result sets, causing nil dereference crashes when those rows are absent": 0.9697901010513306, "Store._hydrateEmbedded unconditionally deletes *_ids attributes even when no embedded collection exists, breaking plain ID-list attributes like muted_category_ids that client code reads/observes": 0.8365784287452698, "Store._hydrateEmbedded drops IDs for embedded relationships when side-loaded data uses a different root key (e.g., featured_user_badges uses root: :user_badges), producing arrays of undefined": 0.7614688873291016, "After saving embeddable host, component sets host.category from potentially null categoryId, clearing the displayed category even though server defaulted to uncategorized": 0.7534331679344177, "Pretender handler for GET /fruits/:id always returns fruits[0] regardless of requested id, so store.find('fruit', 2) returns wrong record and tests don't validate intended behavior": 0.9387471675872803}